+**Your job:**
+1. **The size matrix.** Propose the size classes and the exact test sizes, as the page sees them with the browser's bars, not only full screens:
+   - iPhone SE (375x667);
+   - iPhone 13 mini (375x812);
+   - iPhone 16/17 (393x852, 402x874);
