+   For each phone, give the visible viewport in Safari and in Chrome on iOS with the bars shown (the user's mini is about 375x625) and with them collapsed. Cite where each number comes from, or measure it from a screenshot as above. Write it as a proposed patch to test/e2e/phone-sizes.mjs (new VISIBLE and TABLETS lists, ALL_SIZES extended) in your log. fix-ui-6 applies it.
